{
  "_comment": [
    "Loom Communities permission catalog — the request body for",
    "PUT /v1/apps/loom_communities/permissions (App Access API, replacePermissionCatalog).",
    "",
    "Granularity: one permission per archetype action. `category` is the archetype's",
    "cardSurfaceFamily as declared in docs/references/archetypes/README.md, so the catalog",
    "stays aligned with the JSON grammar's own vocabulary rather than inventing a parallel one.",
    "",
    "The `community.*` block is the only non-archetype category: those are app-level community",
    "administration actions that exist above any single workflow archetype.",
    "",
    "Every id is <archetype_snake_case>.<action>. Ids are stable contract surface — renaming one",
    "orphans every role grant that references it (the API reports these rather than silently",
    "revoking them), so treat additions as cheap and renames as breaking."
  ],
